From 0cdcc004e216b9edde0ca8d45b31a06ab300713a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elpaablo <donopwhile1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 13:39:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vendor.prop: deduplicate OPlus camera props to
 vendor/oplus/camera
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Camera properties (privapp.list, aux.packagelist, defercap, livephoto,
camera.name, 10bit, privileged 3rdparty, packageexcludelist) were defined
in both vendor.prop and vendor/oplus/camera/camera-vendor.mk. The
camera-vendor.mk PRODUCT_PRODUCT_PROPERTIES block is the canonical
location — remove the redundant vendor.prop entries to avoid partition
precedence conflicts.

Change-Id: I566193044da5b160946fbc91460093f62592e6c0
---
 vendor.prop | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vendor.prop b/vendor.prop
index 628d84ed..45a039b6 100644
--- a/vendor.prop
+++ b/vendor.prop
@@ -62,8 +62,8 @@ persist.vendor.qcom.bluetooth.aptxadaptiver2_1_support=true
 ro.bluetooth.a2dp_offload.supported=true
 
 # Camera
-persist.vendor.camera.privapp.list=org.lineageos.aperture,com.oplus.camera,com.ss.android.ugc.aweme,org.codeaurora.snapcam
-vendor.camera.aux.packageexcludelist=org.telegram.messenger,org.thunderdog.challegram,us.zoom.videomeetings
+# NOTE: OPlus camera properties are centralized in vendor/oplus/camera/camera-vendor.mk
+# Only non-OPlus / hardware-layer camera props should remain here.
 
 # Chipset
 ro.soc.manufacturer=QTI
